flowchart LR
    User[Trusted local user] --> Login[Username/password sign-in]
    Login --> Identity[Host-accessible local Keycloak]
    Identity -->|PKCE session| UI[All admin sections]
    UI -->|Bearer token through Nginx| APIs[Catalog / Pricing / Inventory / Configuration]
    APIs --> Auth[Verify signature, issuer, audience and expiry]
    Auth --> Business[Validate request and deterministic business rules]
    Business --> DB[Owning service database with actor audit]
    Anonymous[No valid session] --> Reject[401 response]
